# The evening, stood through. Two places — the coast, where a lit settlement at
# dusk is what docs/ART.md section 10 rests on, and the moss, where the night's
# own floor is most of a dark frame — the hour walked from 17:00 to 21:30 in half
# hours, one frame each. Every pair is held to the one before, AND every half
# hour has to answer `darker`, which is the only thing in a tour that can fail on
# the DIRECTION of the light: `same` is a mean absolute difference and passes a
# half hour that brightens exactly as one that darkens (art review, wave A2).
#
# The game used to get BRIGHTER and bluer from 18:00 to 20:00 and then lose a
# third of its light between 20:00 and 20:30; then it kept a smaller rise at
# 20:00-20:30 on five landscapes of six (moss +11.9%). Either would fail below.
#   tools/tour.sh tours/evening.tour --seed=7 --hour=17 --weather=clear:0
coast calm
weather clear:0

# Stand where a settlement reads: docs/ART.md section 10 rests on a lit town at
# dusk being worth defending, so the frames have to hold one. Walk the last of
# it on the real keys.
village 0
hour 17
zoom 13
wait 0.8
walk 0,1 0.6
wait 1.4
shot 01-the-afternoon-1700 with land:coast
hour 17.5
wait 3.0
await darker 4
shot 02-1730 with land:coast
hour 18
wait 3.0
await darker 4
shot 03-the-turn-begins-1800 with land:coast
hour 18.5
wait 3.0
await darker 4
shot 04-1830 with land:coast
hour 19
wait 3.0
await darker 4
shot 05-low-and-warm-1900 with land:coast
hour 19.5
wait 3.0
await darker 4
shot 06-1930 with land:coast
hour 20
wait 3.0
await darker 4
shot 07-the-lights-come-on-2000 with land:coast
hour 20.5
wait 3.0
await darker 4
shot 08-2030 with land:coast
hour 21
wait 3.0
await darker 4
shot 09-night-lands-2100 with land:coast
hour 21.5
wait 3.0
await darker 4
shot 10-2130 with land:coast

# No half hour of the evening is a step. The crop is the world under the HUD's
# top band and above its bottom one, so a clock reading 20:30 instead of 20:00
# is not what the numbers are measuring.
#
# IT IS IN FRAME PIXELS, AND A TOUR FRAME IS 3840x2160 — the base (UiBase.SIZE,
# 1920x1080) taken x2 by 98_tour._save_frame. It used to read 0,84,1280,592,
# which was that same band written for the 1280x720 frames of the 640x360 floor
# and never rescaled when LANTERN moved the floor. On a 3840x2160 frame that box
# is a corner, and 28% of its rows are the HUD's own message bar: measured on
# 17:00 against 17:30, the bar differs by 51.6 (0-255) and the world under it by
# 6.2, so the tour was grading the evening almost entirely on the one thing this
# comment says it crops out. The pair that this tour failed on reads 0.0859 in
# the old box and 0.0963 in the band below — the correction is stricter, not
# kinder. tours/saves.tour and tours/sky-polish.tour carry crops from the same
# era and have not been checked.
same 01-the-afternoon-1700 02-1730 0.075 0,252,3840,1776
same 02-1730 03-the-turn-begins-1800 0.075 0,252,3840,1776
same 03-the-turn-begins-1800 04-1830 0.075 0,252,3840,1776
same 04-1830 05-low-and-warm-1900 0.075 0,252,3840,1776
same 05-low-and-warm-1900 06-1930 0.075 0,252,3840,1776
same 06-1930 07-the-lights-come-on-2000 0.075 0,252,3840,1776
same 07-the-lights-come-on-2000 08-2030 0.075 0,252,3840,1776
same 08-2030 09-night-lands-2100 0.075 0,252,3840,1776
same 09-night-lands-2100 10-2130 0.075 0,252,3840,1776

# The hour to stand still in.
hour 19.25
wait 1.0
shot 11-the-hour-to-stand-still-in with land:coast

# The lamp in the dusk, on the real key: a flame at seven, a pool at half past
# eight (docs/ART.md section 6, section 10).
hour 19
wait 0.8
tap lamp
wait 0.8
shot 12-a-flame-at-seven with lamp,land:coast
hour 20.5
wait 1.0
shot 13-a-pool-at-half-past-eight with lamp,land:coast
tap lamp
wait 0.5

# AND THE SAME WALK WHERE THE FLOOR IS MOST OF THE FRAME. The coast's own light
# falls steeply enough to hide a badly paced floor; the moss's does not, and the
# moss is where the measured rise was worst. Same half hours, same rule.
place moss
hour 17
wait 2.0
shot 20-the-moss-at-1700 with land:moss
hour 17.5
wait 3.0
await darker 4
hour 18
wait 3.0
await darker 4
shot 21-the-moss-at-1800 with land:moss
hour 18.5
wait 3.0
await darker 4
hour 19
wait 3.0
await darker 4
shot 22-the-moss-at-1900 with land:moss
hour 19.5
wait 3.0
await darker 4
hour 20
wait 3.0
await darker 4
shot 23-the-moss-at-2000 with land:moss
hour 20.5
wait 3.0
await darker 4
shot 24-the-moss-at-2030 with land:moss
hour 21
wait 3.0
await darker 4
shot 25-the-moss-at-2100 with land:moss
hour 21.5
wait 3.0
await darker 4
shot 26-the-moss-at-2130 with land:moss
same 21-the-moss-at-1800 22-the-moss-at-1900 0.09 0,252,3840,1776
same 22-the-moss-at-1900 23-the-moss-at-2000 0.09 0,252,3840,1776
same 23-the-moss-at-2000 24-the-moss-at-2030 0.075 0,252,3840,1776
same 24-the-moss-at-2030 25-the-moss-at-2100 0.075 0,252,3840,1776
same 25-the-moss-at-2100 26-the-moss-at-2130 0.075 0,252,3840,1776

# Each landscape's own evening, by the promise docs/ART.md section 3 makes it.
